{"id":2708,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>6月8日下午，马克思主义学院在科艺苑学术报告厅举行2026届硕士研究生毕业典礼暨学位授予仪式。学院领导、导师代表、毕业班班主任及全体硕士研究生参加典礼，典礼由学院党委副书记李庆乐主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VU4L2PozT7L4NDod7-PUlVRoRCPozl-DnmLbUlMRLzvbM8C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyioSyPMYy8MmWfozA7MzQRMmliL8M2LzN8Uz67LlWkMmfFo7CsMzNiM8MFL8V2MmNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYM4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D5917462A98D56C6553CF194A7D1BB60/8F75957C/3AF69\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VUzf27MNMfUzMkMdl-bUm-DnzvbLmG-DLR62ozCZL4GPU490gihFp2hmCIa0nSy4nkyiLkyaUmNYUmvaollZM4n2UNU4M8UYU8UYUzLbnR6FLlCPozLZL8QFMllsLzQkgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmvigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\"></p><p>在《中华人民共和国国歌》的雄浑歌声中，本次典礼缓缓拉开序幕。学位授予环节，师长们为毕业生拨穗并颁发学位证书，与每位学子合影定格珍贵瞬间。副院长郭玲霞为2026届校友联络员齐家锐颁发聘书，希望她坚守初心，持续搭建校友沟通桥梁。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VUzn22M4Wfo7rRLdNLbn7Qfnz9bU87-sU4-DMz7iLlWVnl-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysUSyPUYhkUNLPLm78LzQknzffoRnfUNC4MRNioRQfLzMFnRrVn778M4WFnRVkL8lJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYM4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/97A1CBBC121416BE0A84ABF349586A13/D5EDA472/D1B3E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozG2Zn7LYozlaLdzAfo7Q7MRr7LR9-PLR-DMlWkMRGZoR90gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfLSyDUShkLm7bMml4L4A7UzAfUzT2MmGbMmv4Uznfo7nFLNUbnzQ2ozQFMNCDLzGigjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmvigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.png\"></p><p>毕业生代表张璐代表全体毕业生发言。她回望研究生阶段的求学时光，由衷感谢学院的悉心培育与导师的悉心教诲。她表示，数年的沉淀与磨砺是青春最珍贵的收获，未来全体毕业生将怀揣感恩之心，砥砺初心、勇担使命，以实干奔赴前路，不负师恩与韶华。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VnRN28LzNbLzCsndmNDMzVVn7M7UN--YMlV7MlVkozv4nzG0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyanSyZMYybU4VfLlUsnz7sUzMkLznRozG4LlQkL4V7oRWFLlQVoR6kU4TFLznRMm9ZgjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmvigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/30E879C1A1D7E17A3B14C9031FB31D82/1FE87BC9/14C688\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VnR924M7-aL7MVodz94Mz6foRAkLl--ZolUsnzAfMNrkM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYnShfLYhVLRlYnzCPozUPozNbMzffU4UYMRGYnRWRLNMFUNnfoRQRU4WFM4v4LNlDgjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmvigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.png\"></p><p>在校生代表崔雅雲向全体毕业学长学姐送上诚挚祝福。她表示，优秀毕业生勤勉治学、奋勇争先的优良风貌为在校生树立了榜样，并代表全体在校生表态，将传承学院优良学风，勤学笃行、接续奋进，潜心钻研专业知识，努力成长为合格的新时代青年。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLm724n7rRo7laLdRMVnN7PU4GDLRl-bMzNsL4N4LzvZL4U0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyboShfLYy4L77Zoz9sMzliMNVkM4-bo77DLznRnNLPoRnFL8UZLz7YL7QFL8nknRCJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYM4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/499A330A89875556AB7298A614CFC184/3D81120F/3DBD6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VnRV2VUNlsUzlsUd8laMRUDLllYMRU-8U8QkLmNYn77DoRv0gihFp2hmCIa0USyYLSyZUShkUNnkL8LbLmUZnlnfL87PozU8U4NDnz7sUmAFnlLaozn7M7rFL8C4L87agtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmvigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\"></p><p>导师代表常开霞老师致辞寄语。她勉励大家坚守治学初心、永葆进取本色。希望毕业生们将读研期间锤炼的钻研精神与思辨能力融入今后的工作生活，不惧挑战、勇毅前行，在人生新赛道持续精进、不负所学。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VU4n2VLNUanz6fMd4W2U874U8MRMR--aLN-aUlWfUm62MmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh7nSyaM1hkU4Gao7W7L498ozAfU4nVMmv8LRA7M7MfLlnFM8L8nz-sMmTFM77PozLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYM4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3DE06BC008BD38498AC4E67408D4CA1D/7C4E2769/4A193\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMmn2RM4vPo77Dnd778M4W7n7C8LRT-foRA7nmMVoRvZM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhVMYy8U1hRLzW2nmLPn7Vko7-ZnNUbL4NYLR-ZUmvsL4AFUzCaLlCZUmfFMNn2MzTVgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmvigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\"></p><p>院长赵笑蕾作总结致辞。她对圆满完成学业的全体毕业生表示热烈祝贺，充分肯定了本届学子在校期间的拼搏成果与亮眼成绩，并围绕“有理想、敢担当、能吃苦、肯奋斗”提出四点殷切期望，希望大家保持坚韧向上的姿态，立足长远、脚踏实地，在新时代的广阔舞台绽放青春光彩，奔赴属于自己的山海征程。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozG2bMRQ7U4GZLd4NZM8M2o7laLlU-4Lm7iU8MRMmvsUzG0gihFp2hmCIa0LSybL1h2MYhfL7-aMNl4n7Q2oRQfnR6koRARnz9aMzTkL8QFMNU4UlnVL4TFL4T2Ll7Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYM4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/192F7A0B06E3DFF86AD7B88CE8059B3F/6D3ADE39/39F1A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VUNn2kLm62MlVRUd4lYUmGaL4QRnmU-sLzMkM4Giol-aMR90gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh7nkhVoky8nRlaLz6Rnl-YnzvaL4nfL7WfUlU4MmGYL7MFo7MVUlU8U4VFLmN4olnkgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmvigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\"></p><p>典礼尾声，学院为全体毕业生送上专属毕业纪念品，将暖心关怀与真挚期许送到每一位学子手中。熟悉的校歌缓缓回荡全场，在李书记饱含温情的毕业寄语中，马克思主义学院2026届硕士研究生毕业典礼暨学位授予仪式圆满落幕。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VLN72bnmviMmU8od774U8C4ozUYMmU-YUzCbUlVVLmLio7U0gihFp2hmCIa0nShVLYybn1yZMm7YMl-sM8UZMRvsnRMVL8l4MRAkMzGPLRTFnl-4Ml-solrFMRUsMz7Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYM4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EE39F86125B77D8477D3E3E348B50109/EB35B79E/44751\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VolM22MN-aLN-ZMdmT7Lm78nR-8UlV-RL4fRozTfoRWknzL0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkhfokh2nSy4LN-PozQRUml4n7CsollZLmCiMznfLNnkLzVFMz-ZnlL8UlnFMRUaoRAVgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLmvigtA8pUWcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg\"></p><p>骊歌悠扬，拨穗礼成，锦绣前路已然铺展，愿诸位学子以信仰为舵、以实干为舟，在新时代征途上高扬中北马院青年的奋进旗帜，凭深厚理论功底与赤诚家国担当投身强国伟业，让青春之花扎根基层沃土、绽放时代荣光！</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VU4L2PozT7L4NDod7-PUlVRoRCPozl-DnmLbUlMRLzvbM8C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyioSyPMYy8MmWfozA7MzQRMmliL8M2LzN8Uz67LlWkMmfFo7CsMzNiM8MFL8V2MmNJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vYM4lJqdWnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7275&e=.jpg"}